                    "description": "This free digital card was made by an Independent Creator and published on Yoto Space. Visit Open Mic on Yoto Space to discover more great free titles!  \n\nCreators: Tales from Willow Grove   \nFrom the Creators: “Step into a world of mystery, wonder, and just-the-right-amount-of-spooky with Tales from Willow Grove!  \n\nDiscover a collection of enchanting, slightly spooky, and heartwarming original stories perfect for curious young listeners. Tales from Willow Grove invites kids to lean in closer and imagine deeper with a mix of folktales, mysteries, and cozy seasonal adventures.  \n\nPLEASE NOTE: These stories are designed to be just the right amount of spooky for kids—think folktales, mysterious twists, and just the right touch of goosebumps! While there are no graphic or gory details, some tales include tense moments (like being followed, mysterious figures, or ghostly legends) that might be a bit intense for sensitive listeners.\"\n\nFor ages: 7–12  \n\nIf your family enjoyed this card, why not let the creator know by adding a comment on Open Mic?  \n\nFeatured on Discover until 31st October \nStays in your library and available on Yoto Space at any time",
